---

Kill a [L_Ender’s Cataclysm](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm) boss. It drops **boss dust** themed to that fight. Eat the dust for potion-like effects (regeneration, strength, fire resistance, and more depending on the boss). Dust can be eaten even at full hunger.

All 8 bosses drop dust:

- Maledictus
- Ancient Remnant
- Ender Guardian
- Scylla
- Netherite Monstrosity
- Ignis
- The Leviathan
- The Harbinger

Advancements track your first dust, all 8 regular dusts, first overcharged dust, and all 8 overcharged dusts.
